-- 1) CMG GRID RADIAL is represented by OPM Flow RADIAL.
-- 2) CMG PVT BG table is translated to PVTO + PVDG.
-- 3) The source PVT table ends at 15347.2 kPa while the initial
--    pressure is 28366 kPa. An undersaturated oil point at 28366 kPa
--    is therefore extrapolated from the final CMG BOT/VOT slopes.
-- 4) CMG well model PWELLBORE / GEOMETRY is represented initially by
--    standard OPM WELSPECS + COMPDAT + WCONPROD. This is not a claim of
--    exact well-model equivalence and should be checked against CMG.
-- 5) The source run contains many monthly DATE records to 2150. This
--    validation deck intentionally runs only the first ~1 year.
-- =====================================================================

